{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）中午12時43分，九龍灣臨興街32號地下一間餐廳發生火警。據報抽油煙槽噴出大量黑煙，整段路面也被煙霧籠罩。 消防員到場約7分鐘後將火</p><p>消防員到場約7分鐘後將火警救熄，其間5人疏散，事件中無人受傷。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133757449397211136642895.png/pAUP_Rycw60U_bx8cdn68CTUzzxIPht4K-mFGyvphRs\" alt=\"餐廳噴出黑煙籠罩街頭。（Threads/@keiko_yc圖片）\"><figcaption>餐廳噴出黑煙籠罩街頭。（Threads/@keiko_yc圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133757447299928064419076.png/yNDYVjC_mACD-xcCyDJ3y_UihjvuX5dmR11VKkddVSo\" alt=\"餐廳噴出黑煙籠罩街頭。（Threads/@keiko_yc圖片）\"><figcaption>餐廳噴出黑煙籠罩街頭。（Threads/@keiko_yc圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133757444674162688760952.png/phwRKd4wV9RNs4KqBbhhiJ2EDIbTHdVVHURc5B1EXOQ\" alt=\"餐廳噴出黑煙籠罩街頭。（Threads/@keiko_yc圖片）\"><figcaption>餐廳噴出黑煙籠罩街頭。（Threads/@keiko_yc圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260520/1133757442069368832832570.png/Lx5Dwy0kX1qITSbjSj1ixIvrhqzzM04iA-FBlwPhQZc\" alt=\"餐廳噴出黑煙籠罩街頭。（Threads/@keiko_yc圖片）\"><figcaption>餐廳噴出黑煙籠罩街頭。（Threads/@keiko_yc圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-20T05:55:10.824012+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}